  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projectile, 105mm High Explosive Ml without Fuze (C445). The use of the Presidential Drawdown Authority to direct a drawdown to provide military assistance under section 506(a)(1) of the Foreign Assistance Act allows for the speedy delivery of defense articles and services from Department of Defense stocks to foreign countries and international organizations to respond to unforeseen emergencies.</narrative>
